<p:sld xmlns:a="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/drawingml/2006/main" xmlns:p="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/presentationml/2006/main" xmlns:r="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/officeDocument/2006/relationships"><p:cSld><p:spTree><p:nvGrpSpPr><p:cNvPr id="1" name=""/><p:cNvGrpSpPr/><p:nvPr/></p:nvGrpSpPr><p:grpSpPr/><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="2" name="TextBox 1"/><p:cNvSpPr txBox="1"/><p:nvPr/></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="923760" y="63000"/><a:ext cx="8399520" cy="1154520"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom><a:noFill/></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr wrap="square" lIns="122040" tIns="60840" rIns="122040" bIns="60840" anchor="b"><a:spAutoFit/></a:bodyPr><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:pPr><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="85000"/></a:lnSpc><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr sz="4400" b="0" i="0" spc="-1"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="374C81"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Century Gothic"/></a:rPr><a:t>CONCLUSION</a:t></a:r></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="3" name="TextBox 2"/><p:cNvSpPr txBox="1"/><p:nvPr/></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="923760" y="1406880"/><a:ext cx="8399520" cy="3695400"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom><a:noFill/></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr wrap="square" lIns="122040" tIns="60840" rIns="122040" bIns="60840"><a:spAutoFit/></a:bodyPr><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:pPr marL="304920" indent="-304200"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="95000"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcBef><a:spcPts val="1100"/></a:spcBef><a:buClr><a:srgbClr val="374C81"/></a:buClr><a:buFont typeface="Arial"/><a:buChar char="•"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr sz="1900" b="0" i="0" spc="-1"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="374C81"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Century Gothic"/></a:rPr><a:t>A fault is a cause, an error is a bad state, a failure is what the user sees - fault tolerance means breaking that chain</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="304920" indent="-304200"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="95000"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcBef><a:spcPts val="1100"/></a:spcBef><a:buClr><a:srgbClr val="374C81"/></a:buClr><a:buFont typeface="Arial"/><a:buChar char="•"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr sz="1900" b="0" i="0" spc="-1"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="374C81"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Century Gothic"/></a:rPr><a:t>The toolbox is redundancy, replication, failover, checkpointing, retries and graceful degradation - each with a price tag</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="304920" indent="-304200"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="95000"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcBef><a:spcPts val="1100"/></a:spcBef><a:buClr><a:srgbClr val="374C81"/></a:buClr><a:buFont typeface="Arial"/><a:buChar char="•"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr sz="1900" b="0" i="0" spc="-1"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="374C81"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Century Gothic"/></a:rPr><a:t>Reliability, availability, maintainability and fault tolerance are different targets; MTBF, MTTR and availability tell us how well we hit them</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="304920" indent="-304200"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="95000"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcBef><a:spcPts val="1100"/></a:spcBef><a:buClr><a:srgbClr val="374C81"/></a:buClr><a:buFont typeface="Arial"/><a:buChar char="•"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr sz="1900" b="0" i="0" spc="-1"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="374C81"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Century Gothic"/></a:rPr><a:t>For a Zimbabwean hospital the winning design is boring on purpose: a hot standby, a replicated database, two ISPs, backup power, offline operation and a rehearsed recovery plan</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="304920" indent="-304200"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="95000"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcBef><a:spcPts val="1100"/></a:spcBef><a:buClr><a:srgbClr val="374C81"/></a:buClr><a:buFont typeface="Arial"/><a:buChar char="•"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr sz="1900" b="0" i="0" spc="-1"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="374C81"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Century Gothic"/></a:rPr><a:t>Perfect fault tolerance is impossible - the engineering question is which failures are worth paying to survive</a:t></a:r></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="4" name="TextBox 3"/><p:cNvSpPr txBox="1"/><p:nvPr/></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="8407800" y="5292000"/><a:ext cx="915120" cy="264600"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom><a:noFill/></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr wrap="none" lIns="122040" tIns="60840" rIns="122040" bIns="60840" anchor="b"><a:spAutoFit/></a:bodyPr><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:pPr algn="r"/><a:fld id="{26B7FBC0-90D7-43A1-9DD3-FB7487A9384F}" type="slidenum"><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" b="0" spc="-1"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="595959"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Century Gothic"/></a:rPr><a:t>27</a:t></a:fld></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp></p:spTree></p:cSld><p:clrMapOvr><a:masterClrMapping/></p:clrMapOvr></p:sld>